  "body": "Set in a sought-after part of Long Bay, this beautifully designed new build offers modern comfort, well-proportioned living and an easy coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully planned across two levels, the home features a well-considered layout with multiple living areas and a seamless connection to the outdoors. A private balcony adds another space to relax and enjoy the park outlook, while two ensuites provide added comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n- Standalone home on a freehold section\r\n- Modern open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Multiple living areas\r\n- Two ensuites\r\n- Balcony with park outlook\r\n- Internal-access garage with additional off-street parking\r\n- Outdoor decking\r\n- Modern, low-maintenance living\r\n- Sought-after Long Bay location\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Long Bay with the beach, regional park, local cafes, restaurants and Long Bay Village all close by. Quality schooling and easy access to Albany and the motorway further add to the convenience.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully designed and ready to enjoy.\r\n\r\nContact the listing agent for a viewing\r\nKelvin Su | 021 299 5804 | kelvin.su@raywhite.com\r\nCatherine Liu |021 0200 6788 | catherine.liu@raywhite.com\r\n\r\n*Disclaimer: Rendered images are artist impressions for illustrative purposes only and may not accurately represent the property's final appearance, finishes, colours, landscaping or surrounding environment. Prospective purchasers should rely on their own inspection and enquiries.",
